+# Wire Serialisation Format
+
+This project has no current recorded decision on the wire serialisation format. An earlier decision (msgpack) was later revised in chat toward cbor, but that change was never committed as a recorded project decision, and the decision record tracked for this topic was subsequently modified without a stated value. No `config/decisions` entry for the wire format exists in this repository. Until a decision is recorded, no wire serialisation format should be assumed to be settled policy.
